---
title: Authentication & Authorization Flow
config:
  theme: default
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant MA as Mobile App
    participant WEB as Web Dashboard
    participant API as OrdrMate API
    participant JWT as JWT Service
    participant AUTH as Auth Middleware
    participant GOOGLE as Google OAuth
    participant DB as Database
    participant ADMIN as Admin Handler
    participant BM as Branch Manager Handler
    participant RM as Restaurant Manager Handler

    Note over U, RM: User Registration Flow
    U->>MA: Register new account
    MA->>API: POST /api/customer/register (RegisterUserDto)
    API->>API: Validate user data
    API->>DB: Check if user exists
    DB-->>API: User existence check
    
    alt User Already Exists
        API-->>MA: Error: User already registered
    else New User
        API->>DB: Create new user record
        DB-->>API: User created successfully
        API->>JWT: GenerateToken(user)
        JWT-->>API: JWT token
        API-->>MA: Registration success + token
    end

    Note over U, RM: Google OAuth Login Flow
    U->>MA: Login with Google
    MA->>GOOGLE: Initialize OAuth flow
    GOOGLE->>U: Google consent screen
    U->>GOOGLE: Grant permissions
    GOOGLE->>MA: OAuth callback with code
    MA->>API: POST /api/customer/google-login (GoogleTokenDto)
    API->>GOOGLE: Verify token with Google
    GOOGLE-->>API: User profile data
    
    API->>DB: Find or create user
    alt Existing User
        DB-->>API: User found
    else New User
        API->>DB: Create user from Google profile
        DB-->>API: New user created
    end
    
    API->>JWT: GenerateToken(user)
    JWT-->>API: JWT token
    API-->>MA: Login success + token

    Note over U, RM: Email/Password Login Flow
    U->>MA: Login with email/password
    MA->>API: POST /api/customer/login (LoginDto)
    API->>DB: Find user by email
    DB-->>API: User data
    
    alt User Not Found
        API-->>MA: Error: Invalid credentials
    else User Found
        API->>API: Verify password hash
        alt Password Invalid
            API-->>MA: Error: Invalid credentials
        else Password Valid
            API->>JWT: GenerateToken(user)
            JWT-->>API: JWT token
            API-->>MA: Login success + token
        end
    end

    Note over U, RM: Dashboard Access Flow (Admin/Manager)
    U->>WEB: Access admin dashboard
    WEB->>API: Request with JWT token
    API->>+AUTH: ValidateJwtToken()
    AUTH->>JWT: VerifyToken()
    JWT-->>AUTH: Token validation result

    alt Token Invalid/Expired
        AUTH-->>API: Unauthorized
        API-->>WEB: 401 Unauthorized
        WEB-->>U: Redirect to login
    else Token Valid
        AUTH->>DB: Get user details
        DB-->>AUTH: User data with roles
        AUTH-->>-API: Authenticated user context
        
        Note over API, RM: Role-Based Authorization
        alt Admin Access Required
            API->>+ADMIN: Handle authorization
            ADMIN->>ADMIN: Check if user has Admin role
            alt User is Admin
                ADMIN-->>API: Authorization granted
                API-->>WEB: Protected resource data
            else User not Admin
                ADMIN-->>-API: 403 Forbidden
                API-->>WEB: Access denied
            end
        
        else Branch Manager Access Required
            API->>+BM: Handle authorization
            BM->>BM: Check if user manages this branch
            BM->>DB: Verify branch management relationship
            DB-->>BM: Branch relationship data
            alt User manages branch
                BM-->>-API: Authorization granted
                API-->>WEB: Branch-specific data
            else User doesn't manage branch
                BM-->>API: 403 Forbidden
                API-->>WEB: Access denied
            end
        
        else Restaurant Manager Access Required
            API->>+RM: Handle authorization
            RM->>RM: Check if user owns restaurant
            RM->>DB: Verify restaurant ownership
            DB-->>RM: Ownership data
            alt User owns restaurant
                RM-->>API: Authorization granted
                API-->>WEB: Restaurant management data
            else User doesn't own restaurant
                RM-->>-API: 403 Forbidden
                API-->>WEB: Access denied
            end
        end
    end

    Note over U, RM: Token Refresh Flow
    MA->>API: Request with expired token
    API->>AUTH: ValidateJwtToken()
    AUTH-->>API: Token expired
    API-->>MA: 401 Unauthorized + token expired
    
    MA->>API: POST /api/customer/refresh-token
    API->>JWT: ValidateRefreshToken()
    alt Refresh Token Valid
        JWT->>JWT: Generate new access token
        JWT-->>API: New JWT token
        API-->>MA: New token issued
        MA->>MA: Update stored token
        MA->>API: Retry original request with new token
    else Refresh Token Invalid
        JWT-->>API: Invalid refresh token
        API-->>MA: Please login again
        MA-->>U: Redirect to login
    end

    Note over U, RM: Role Elevation Flow
    U->>WEB: Request to become restaurant manager
    WEB->>API: POST /api/customer/upgrade-role
    API->>AUTH: Validate current user
    AUTH-->>API: Current user context
    
    API->>DB: Update user role to RestaurantManager
    DB-->>API: Role updated
    
    API->>JWT: GenerateTokenWithNewRole(user)
    JWT-->>API: Updated JWT token
    API-->>WEB: Role elevation success + new token
    WEB-->>U: Access granted to management features
